        "original_id": "68f97958-c92a-5cce-a2c3-a5d85a73a3a5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Luca Brecel, Shaun Murphy, Chris Norbury, Dave Harold\n- Events: 2017 China Championship, Paul Hunter Classic\n- Topics: snooker achievements, playing style, tournament results\n\nFacts:\n- In 2008, Chris Norbury reached the latter stages of the Paul Hunter Classic and lost 4–1 to Shaun Murphy in the first round.\n- In 2009, Chris Norbury again reached the latter stages of the Paul Hunter Classic and lost 4–2 to Dave Harold.\n- Shaun Murphy is nicknamed \"The Magician\" and is noted for his straight cue action and long potting.\n- In 2017, Luca Brecel became the first player from mainland Europe to win a ranking event by defeating Shaun Murphy in the final of the China Championship.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "48e0770e-8692-5f36-86d9-6af11996f8f4",
        "text": "Page: Luca Brecel. Sentence: The following year, he became the first player from mainland Europe to win a ranking event, defeating Shaun Murphy in the final of the 2017 China Championship.\nPage: Shaun Murphy (snooker player). Sentence: Nicknamed \"The Magician\", Murphy is noted for his straight cue action and his long potting.\nPage: Chris Norbury. Sentence: He played in the latter stages of the Paul Hunter Classic in both 2008 and 2009, losing in the first round to Shaun Murphy 4–1 in 2008, and losing to Dave Harold 4–2 in 2009.",
